  Slug: fire-warden
  DisplayName: Fire Warden
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Whether you fought against fires in the wilderness or in crowded city
    streets, you've had your fair share of dealing with uncontrolled flames. Battling
    thick smoke and toxic fumes, you've broken down obstacles to save trapped people
    from a fiery grave, and you've studied the nature and source of fire itself to
    try and better learn how to fight it. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be
    to Strength or Constitution , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in the Athletics skill and the Plane of Fire Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Breath
    Control] feat.
